MXGPU (MacXVM)
Copyright (c) the MacXVM project

This package contains the MXGPU kernel extension, the Metal plug-in, the AIR
translator and the video components that were built from the sources of this
repository on a macOS builder.

The package embeds no Apple source file, no NVIDIA firmware, no Apple SDK and
no NullMoth code. The components that were consulted while writing MXGPU are
listed in third_party.lock.json with their license; none of them is
redistributed inside this package.

The release key of the packages is named in the manifest and its fingerprint
lives in resources/mxgpu-release-public-key.txt of the MacXVM repository.
